== Effect ==
* Upon taking damage, randomly activates one of the following dice's effect:
** {{i|The D6}}
** {{i|D8}}
** {{i|D12}}
** {{i|D20}}
** {{i|D10|r}}
* {{dlc|r}} The chance to activate is 50%, and each of the 5 dice have an equal probability to be picked.

== Notes ==
* This trinket can be used in conjunction with the {{i|IV Bag}} or a {{m|Blood Donation Machine}} to generate unlimited pickups and items.
* {{dlc|r}} Cracked Dice has a chance to re-roll the spike in the middle of a {{r|Sacrifice Room}}, making it unusable.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either increases the chance to activate a dice to 75%. Having both to 100%.

